msgid "bytes after the NUL terminator: refused (not a name this tool restores)"
msgstr "NUL 终止符之后还有字节：拒绝（不是本工具可恢复的名称）"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/devname.rs
msgid "the saved name is empty: refused"
msgstr "保存的名称为空：拒绝"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/devname.rs
msgid "the fragments do not spell the saved name"
msgstr "片段拼不出保存的名称"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/devname.rs apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/forget.rs
msgid "keyboard not connected"
msgstr "键盘未连接"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/devname.rs
msgid "battery below 20 % and state not 'normal' (or unknown)"
msgstr "电量低于 20 % 且状态不是“normal”（或未知）"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/devname.rs apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/forget.rs
msgid "circuit breaker open: the keyboard stopped answering"
msgstr "断路器已断开：键盘停止响应"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/devname.rs
msgid "the last hardware read failed or was incomplete"
msgstr "上次硬件读取失败或不完整"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/devname.rs
msgid "`akmctl doctor` is not green (link health, pairing, configuration)"
msgstr "`akmctl doctor` 未显示正常（链路状况、配对、配置）"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/devname.rs
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"outgoing MTU of the L2CAP control channel unknown: it must be read (akm-"
"helper hid-inspect, read-only) and be >= {min} before a 66-byte frame is sent"
msgstr ""
"L2CAP 控制通道的发送 MTU 未知：必须先读取（akm-helper hid-inspect，只读）且不"
"小于 {min}，才能发送 66 字节的帧"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/devname.rs
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"outgoing MTU of the L2CAP control channel is {m}, below {min}: a 66-byte "
"frame cannot be sent in one piece (Linux hidp does not fragment; the HID "
"session would be terminated)"
msgstr ""
"L2CAP 控制通道的发送 MTU 为 {m}，小于 {min}：66 字节的帧无法一次发出（Linux "
"hidp 不分片；HID 会话将被终止）"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/firmware.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Firmware: {v} - up to date (latest public version known)"
msgstr "固件：{v} - 已是最新（已知的最新公开版本）"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/firmware.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Firmware: {v} - update available from Apple (latest known: {l})"
msgstr "固件：{v} - Apple 提供了更新（已知最新：{l}）"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/firmware.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Firmware: {v} - no public Apple update for this model"
msgstr "固件：{v} - 此型号没有 Apple 公开更新"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/firmware.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Firmware: {v} - unknown (model or version not in the table)"
msgstr "固件：{v} - 未知（型号或版本不在表中）"

