#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli.rs
msgid "empty name (use --reset to restore the keyboard's own name)"
msgstr "名称为空（使用 --reset 恢复键盘自身的名称）"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_i18n.rs
